notes.content:
Pardon my mess, had to upload this quick update to test out the achievements, which all appear to be working. There's going to be a bit of wonkiness until I test everything out a few more times, the next biggest priority will be to add two new graphics options for v-sync and no anti-alias, and with V-Sync and anti-alias, just in case some may need it or prefer it one way or the other...

Anywho, current update now has:
Maps (I'm working to fix a quick presentation stutter, for next update);
Final Stage (if you make it past Neo City in time);
Added time, because of the slightly longer first level;
New ending;
6 new achievements;

Hope ya'lls enjoy, and if you'd rather wait for a more polished update, I'll probably get that done during this long weekend. 
Take care.
